{
  "component_type": "dagster_component_templates.DataframeToIterableComponent",
  "description": "Reverse-ETL sink \u2014 POST DataFrame rows to Iterable via bulk endpoints. Two modes: `users` (POST /api/users/bulkUpdate, up to 1000/batch) or `events` (POST /api/events/trackBulk, up to 1000/batch).",
